2026-10-31T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2389) 'the sandbox addon is built at double
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2389  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2389) 'The addon at double is built from &{repo("entities-godot-sandbox", planned: "4-entities")} at `b1118e` plus its binary-translation emitter, by `addon.yml` in the same workflows' home. It is released on a tag and vendored into `addons/godot_sandbox/bin` under the names the `.gdextension` already maps, with commit, flags and sha256 in `CITATION.cff`.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2389  1 LINE
 Text:Written

