 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2389) 'The build command and the unrecorded binaries
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2389  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2389) 'The build is `scons platform=windows arch=x86_64 target=template_release precision=double use_mingw=yes use_llvm=yes`, the linux x86_64 and macos arm64 twins. The unrecorded double binaries in `taskweft-godot-sandbox` are not copied.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2389  1 LINE
 Text:Written

